	(text "R1 = 3.6k ohm | R2 = 15k ohm | NTC = 10k ohm @ 25C | RGPIO = 1k ohm | CGPIO = 1uF\n\nStep 1 - R2 parallel with NTC (at 25C):\n  R2_parallel_NTC = (15000 * 10000) / (15000 + 10000) = 6000 ohm\n\nStep 2 - R1 parallel with (R2||NTC):\n  R_thevenin = (3600 * 6000) / (3600 + 6000) = 2250 ohm\n\nStep 3 - Total series resistance seen by CGPIO:\n  R_total = 1000 + 2250 = 3250 ohm\n\nStep 4 - Cutoff frequency:\n  fc = 1 / (2*pi*R_total*CGPIO)\n  fc = 1 / (2*pi*3250*0.000001)\n  fc = 1 / 0.02042\n  fc = 48.97 Hz\n\nRESULT: fc = 48.97 Hz (fixed, single value for this design)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
